    "updated_at": "2022-02-23T22:34:35Z",
    "body": "Okay, I could pin down the issue. The issue occurs when using either a hex color _or_ bold for starships's `$style` configurations. using only ansi colors and no bold fixes the prompt.\r\n\r\nStill not sure whether this is a problem on Terminus' or on starship's side, but I think that should help you to narrow it down?\r\n\r\nWhile the lack of hex colors isn't a big deal, the lack of bold is a bit annoying, especially the fact that starship in Terminus does not fail gracefully. So right now, I am using two different starship configs, one for Terminus, one for everything else. 🙈 ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
