    "updated_at": "2022-02-28T23:06:18Z",
    "body": "Found it.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/randy3k/Terminus/issues/343#issuecomment-1040012748\r\n\r\nIt looks like the following items are not supported in Terminus:\r\n- 24 bit colors (i.e. colors via hex codes)\r\n- Bold font\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, both of these issues are WONTFIXes. If you want starship to work in Terminus, you'll need to make sure that you don't use the `bold` styling, and that you don't use 24-bit colors (i.e. do not use any color code prefixed by a `#`).",
